          "$AB^2 = 7{,}84 + 4{,}41 = 12{,}25$",
          "$AB = \\sqrt{12{,}25} = 3{,}5\\,\\mathrm{cm}$"
        ],
        "result": "AB = 3{,}5\\,\\mathrm{cm}"
